d\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-cinema-4d-beta-2\">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"3d-on-product-pages-woocommerce-magento-bigcommerce-salesforce\">3D on product pages: WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3d-on-product-pages-woocommerce-magento-bigcommerce-salesforce\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Put the Verse 3D viewer in your product gallery. Each product gets one Verse link, and each variant can have its own. When a shopper picks a colour or a finish, the viewer switches to that variant&#39;s scene. The product image is shown first, and the 3D loads when the shopper scrolls to it, so product pages stay fast.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Store</th><th>What you install</th><th>How it shows</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>WooCommerce</strong></td><td>A WordPress plugin</td><td>First slide of the product gallery, or in place of the featured image</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Magento 2 / Adobe Commerce</strong></td><td>A module (<code>ctruh/module-verse</code>)</td><td>First frame of the product gallery (fotorama), or in place of the main image</td></tr><tr><td><strong>BigCommerce</strong></td><td>An app (OAuth install)</td><td>Before, or in place of, the main product image</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Salesforce Commerce Cloud</strong></td><td>SFRA: the <code>int_verse</code> cartridge. Composable Storefront (PWA Kit): a React component</td><td>First slide of the image carousel / next to the image gallery</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Shopify</strong></td><td>The Verse 3D viewer app block</td><td>See <a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere#shopify-product-pages\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere\">Embed anywhere</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Status.</strong> WooCommerce is verified on a real store. Magento, BigCommerce and Salesforce Commerce Cloud are built and tested against stand-ins; their store listings (Adobe Commerce Marketplace, BigCommerce App Marketplace, Salesforce AppExchange) are pending, so for now you install them from the code in <code>integrations/commerce/</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-link\">The link<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#the-link\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>In <a href=\"/studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-studio\">Studio</a>, open the scene and copy its share link, for example <code>https://verse.ctruh.com/?vpk=ingest/&lt;scene-id&gt;.vpk</code> or <code>https://verse.ctruh.com/view?glb=ingest/&lt;scene-id&gt;.fidelity.glb</code>. For a private scene, create an embed share link. It carries the scene&#39;s token (<code>&amp;share=…</code>).</p>\n<ul><li><strong>One scene per variant</strong>: give each variant its own link.</li><li><strong>One scene, several materials</strong>: if the model has material variants (KHR_materials_variants, see <a href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-3\">Build a configurator</a>), use the same link with <code>&amp;variant=&lt;name&gt;</code> for each variant, for example <code>…&amp;variant=Midnight%20Blue</code>.</li><li><strong>No link on a variant</strong>: the variant shows the product&#39;s scene.</li></ul>\n<p>Every integration accepts <strong>https links to your Verse server only</strong>: <code>https://verse.ctruh.com</code>, or your own server if you <a href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-one\">run one</a>. Anything else is refused when you save it and is never shown to shoppers. That includes <code>http:</code> links, links to other sites and <code>javascript:</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"woocommerce\">WooCommerce<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#woocommerce\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li>Get <code>verse-for-woocommerce-1.0.0.zip</code> from Ctruh. Then go to <strong>Plugins → Add New → Upload Plugin</strong> and activate it. It needs WooCommerce 8.2 or newer and WordPress 6.5 or newer.</li><li>Go to <strong>WooCommerce → Settings → Products → Verse 3D</strong>. Set the server (keep <code>https://verse.ctruh.com</code>), where it goes in the gallery (<em>first slide</em>, <em>instead of the featured image</em>, or <em>not in the gallery</em>), when it loads (<em>when visible</em>, <em>on tap</em> or <em>straight away</em>) and the shape.</li><li>Edit a product and paste the link into the <strong>Verse 3D link</strong> box on the right. For variable products, go to <strong>Product data → Variations</strong>, open a variation and fill in <strong>Verse 3D link</strong>.</li></ol>\n<p>With <em>not in the gallery</em>, put <code>[verse_product]</code> wherever you want the viewer (for example in the description), or <code>[verse_product id=&quot;123&quot; load=&quot;tap&quot; aspect=&quot;16:9&quot;]</code>. The plugin works with WooCommerce&#39;s order storage (HPOS) and the block checkout. Uninstalling it removes its settings and every product&#39;s Verse link.</p>\n<h2 id=\"magento-2-adobe-commerce\">Magento 2 / Adobe Commerce<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#magento-2-adobe-commerce\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li>Install the module. With Composer: <code>composer require ctruh/module-verse</code> once it is on the Marketplace, or copy <code>Ctruh/Verse</code> to <code>app/code/Ctruh/Verse</code>. Then:\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"sh\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-sh\">bin/magento module:enable Ctruh_Verse &amp;&amp; bin/magento setup:upgrade &amp;&amp; bin/magento cache:flush</code></pre></div></li><li>Go to <strong>Stores → Configuration → Catalog → Verse 3D Viewer</strong>. Set the server, load mode and gallery position. They can differ per store view.</li><li>Edit a product. In the <strong>Verse 3D</strong> group, fill in <strong>Verse 3D link</strong> (store-view scope). For configurable products, give the child products their own links. Swatches and drop-downs switch the viewer to the chosen child.</li></ol>\n<p>The module adds your Verse server to the storefront&#39;s Content Security Policy (<code>script-src</code>, <code>frame-src</code>, <code>img-src</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"bigcommerce\">BigCommerce<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#bigcommerce\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li>Install the <strong>Ctruh Verse 3D</strong> app from the link Ctruh sends you. It adds the storefront script to your store (Script Manager) by itself.</li><li>Open the app in your control panel. Check the server and placement, then paste a Verse link next to each product and, if you want, next to each variant. Save.</li><li>The viewer appears before the main product image on the product page. Choose <em>Only where the theme has <code>&lt;div data-verse-mount&gt;</code></em> to place it yourself in your Stencil theme.</li></ol>\n<p>The links are stored on your products as metafields. Uninstalling the app removes its script and its data.</p>\n<h2 id=\"salesforce-commerce-cloud\">Salesforce Commerce Cloud<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#salesforce-commerce-cloud\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p><strong>SFRA (Storefront Reference Architecture)</strong></p>\n<ol><li>Upload the <code>int_verse</code> cartridge and add it to the front of your storefront&#39;s cartridge path: <code>int_verse:app_storefront_base</code>.</li><li>Import <code>metadata/</code> (Administration → Site Development → Import &amp; Export). It adds the product attribute <strong>Verse 3D link</strong> (<code>verseLink</code>) and the <strong>Ctruh Verse 3D</strong> site preferences. Turn on <em>Show the Verse 3D viewer</em>.</li><li>Add one line to your PDP template, right after the image carousel: <code>&lt;isinclude template=&quot;product/components/verseViewer&quot; /&gt;</code>.</li><li>Fill in <strong>Verse 3D link</strong> on masters and variants (a variant without one shows the master&#39;s scene).</li></ol>\n<p>There are no controllers or hooks. The viewer is moved into the carousel and follows the variation choice in the browser.</p>\n<p><strong>Composable Storefront (PWA Kit)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"jsx\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-2\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-jsx\">import { VerseProductViewer } from &quot;@ctruhtech/verse-pwa-kit&quot;;\n// in your product detail page, next to &lt;ImageGallery&gt;:\n&lt;VerseProductViewer product={product} server=&quot;https://verse.ctruh.com&quot; /&gt;</code></pre></div>\n<p><code>product</code> is the page&#39;s product. Once the shopper picks a variant, it is the selected variant, and the viewer follows it. The component reads <code>c_verseLink</code> and is built on <code>@ctruhtech/verse-react</code> (<a href=\"/docs/developers#verse-viewer\" id=\"lnk-developers-2\">developers</a>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"content-security-policy\">Content Security Policy<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#content-security-policy\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<p>If your store sends a CSP, allow your Verse server in <code>script-src</code> (it serves <code>embed.js</code>), <code>frame-src</code> (the viewer runs in a frame on the Verse server) and <code>img-src</code> (posters). Magento&#39;s module does this for you. None of the integrations add inline scripts to your pages.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-shoppers-get\">What shoppers get<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-shoppers-get\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-8\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The same viewer as every Verse embed (<a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere#what-visitors-get\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-2\">Embed anywhere</a>): the poster first, the 3D when it is on screen, page scrolling that still works on phones, a fullscreen button and, for product-size scenes, <a href=\"/docs/guides/view-in-ar\" id=\"lnk-view-in-ar\">View in AR</a> on phones. The viewer runs on the Verse server inside a frame, so it never runs code on your store&#39;s pages.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#the-link\" id=\"lnk-the-link\">The link</a><a href=\"#woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-woocommerce\">WooCommerce</a><a href=\"#magento-2-adobe-commerce\" id=\"lnk-magento-2-adobe-commerce\">Magento 2 / Adobe Commerce</a><a href=\"#bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-bigcommerce\">BigCommerce</a><a href=\"#salesforce-commerce-cloud\" id=\"lnk-salesforce-commerce-cloud\">Salesforce Commerce Cloud</a><a href=\"#content-security-policy\" id=\"lnk-content-security-policy\">Content Security Policy</a><a href=\"#what-shoppers-get\" id=\"lnk-what-shoppers-get\">What shoppers get</a></aside></section>"}